koinos-bsp-jh7110 (1.0-1~koinos1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of JH7110 BSP package
  * Kernel modules for JH7110 peripherals
  * Device Tree overlays for VisionFive 2, Milk-V Mars, Star64, PineTab-V
  * 8GB memory override for VisionFive 2
  * PCB revision SD card overlays (v1.2B/v1.3A)
  * GPU support for Imagination BXE-4-32

